# ==========================================================
# Vercel -> Project Settings -> Environment Variables (frontend)
# ==========================================================
# The frontend is plain static HTML/CSS/JS, so it reads this value
# at build time via vercel.json OR you can simply set the backend URL
# once from the login screen (it is stored in the browser).
#
# Recommended: edit frontend/config.js and set API_BASE_URL, or set:
API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
